{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01NgkhiuNic4YLK5T5Jytc52","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01C4pYFkcEBPQz7biwbAp2Fr","name":"SendMessage","input":{"to":"aa1a32d82f8cf9735","message":"## Step 2: Cross-Share — R2's Review\n\nR2 (Novelty + Related Work) scored the paper **4/6 (Weak Accept)** with confidence 4/5. Here are their key points:\n\n**R2 Strengths:**\n- Sign misattribution formalization fills a genuine gap with clean empirical evidence\n- \"Contrarian solution\" framing (coarser but correct credit > finer but corrupted credit) challenges community assumptions in an interesting way\n- Honest calibration — acknowledges zero algorithmic novelty, reports GAE outperforming\n\n**R2 Critical Weaknesses:**\n- Core insight is relatively predictable for an RL expert — sign error follows directly from group normalization with binary rewards\n- Episode-level GRPO = REINFORCE, so algorithmic novelty is zero\n- **Turn-PPO** (which identifies \"uniform advantage\" as a closely related problem) is not engaged with — R2 considers this HIGH severity\n- Only 10 references is unacceptable for a top venue\n- 46.8% performance vs 86-97% SoTA on ALFWorld limits practical impact\n- B-IAVR incremental over Thinkless/ARES, lacks multi-seed validation\n\n**R2 Score Rationale:** The diagnostic contribution alone, if deepened, could clear the bar. The sign misattribution formalization and empirical verification (r=0.87) are genuinely useful to the community. But missing engagement with Turn-PPO, thin references, and weak B-IAVR results hold it back.\n\n---\n\n**Your task:** Given R2's perspective, please:\n1. Note where you agree or disagree with R2\n2. Would R2's points about novelty (predictability of the insight, Turn-PPO gap) change your assessment?\n3. Does R2's more favorable view of the diagnostic contribution shift your score?\n4. State your updated score if any, with brief justification.\n\nKeep response under 300 words."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4277,"cache_read_input_tokens":52077,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4277},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"03539836-91ef-4e0c-a664-f46ce3e7053e","uuid":"466e8038-8eaf-42fe-b262-7e30aa9a3a9a"}
